# 🏠 Mortgage Data Price Prediction using Machine Learning

## 📖 Overview

This project focuses on predicting mortgage values using a complete Machine Learning workflow on the Mortgage Data dataset. The notebook covers data exploration, preprocessing, feature engineering, model training, hyperparameter tuning, and performance evaluation to identify the most accurate regression model.

Multiple regression algorithms were trained and compared using **RandomizedSearchCV** with **K-Fold Cross Validation**. Their performances were evaluated using cross-validation scores and regression metrics to determine the best-performing model.

📓 **Kaggle Notebook:**  
https://www.kaggle.com/code/abacilla/mortgage-data#5.-Machine-Learning-and-Hyperparameter-Tuning

