# 📊 Dataset

The Mortgage Data dataset contains numerical and categorical features related to mortgage applications and property financing. These attributes are used to build regression models capable of predicting the target mortgage value.

**Target Variable**

- Mortgage Value

> **Note:** The dataset is too large to upload to GitHub, so only the Kaggle dataset link is provided.

