# 🏆 Results

Models were ranked according to their **Best Cross-Validation R² Score**.

| Rank | Model | Best CV Score (R²) |
|------|-------------------------|----------------:|
| 🥇 | LightGBM Regressor | **0.996096** |
| 🥈 | XGBoost Regressor | **0.995604** |
| 🥉 | Decision Tree Regressor | **0.980499** |
| 4 | Ridge Regression | **0.967363** |
| 5 | Linear Regression | **0.967363** |
| 6 | ElasticNet Regression | **0.967362** |
| 7 | Lasso Regression | **0.967329** |
| 8 | Random Forest Regressor | **0.959799** |

---

### 🏅 Best Model Performance

**Best Model:** 🥇 **LightGBM Regressor**

| Metric | Value |
|---------|-------:|
| MAE | **0.024563** |
| RMSE | **0.034071** |
| R² Score | **0.995906** |

---

### 🔍 Key Findings

- LightGBM achieved the highest cross-validation score among all evaluated models.
- XGBoost delivered performance very close to the best-performing model.
- Tree-based boosting algorithms significantly outperformed traditional linear regression models.
- RandomizedSearchCV successfully optimized model hyperparameters for improved predictive performance.
- Cross-validation provided a reliable comparison across all regression models.
- Proper preprocessing and feature scaling contributed to highly accurate mortgage value predictions.

